# Generated & vendored web assets: preserve exact bytes, never convert EOLs.
# Keeps `make css` output byte-identical to the committed file on every platform
# (Tailwind CLI writes LF) and preserves vendored JS integrity for the offline
# check. Without this, autocrlf=true rewrites them to CRLF on checkout.
web/static/*.css -text
web/static/*.js  -text
